{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Synchronize the mid-step pause test**\n\nA fixed 50 ms sleep does not guarantee that `step1` has started. On a loaded runner, the execution can be paused before its first invocation and the assertions still pass without exercising mid-step token revocation. Wait for the `StepStarted` event (or use explicit thread synchronization) before pausing, then resume and assert the final `s1s2` result to cover the checkpoint-derived deferred invocation.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM74mu2C","finding_digest":"897017c096f5fcd8a6ce58edf31c0cd4c6411b6d7dd16f1c94f7fc2a768fa649","finding_id":"arf_v1_rfybpqew6x6nrjwoldw7gham2t","finding_key":"testing/e2e/pause_resume_test.py::test_pause_mid_step_holds_back_the_next_step::unsynchronized-precondition","identity_key":"testing/e2e/pause_resume_test.py::test_pause_mid_step_holds_back_the_next_step::unsynchronized-precondition","line":100,"observation_digest":"8ecfb8fa3e463aeaba11b1e08a89731a8928363538075890f21dff0b0e8b2159","observation_id":"aro_v1_r3h3r6r6iy5ovoqrwhqivcltdk","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/tests/e2e/pause_resume_test.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-03T00:26:43Z","review_id":"arr_v1_lcnht7fvcsaj6hopgjcqmw6rzl","reviewed_base_sha":"631b78d1b505b157eee758662291fc5e2353bbb6","reviewed_head_sha":"c234aaf4d40e248ff3e8eed1d673c10a34df05c5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":100,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":757},"record_id":"art_v1_xhzqlslapiar2iqi7mybzhyfpu","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-03T00:26:43Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
